  "notes": [
    "Pairs accept swaps only from DemaxConfig.platform(). The age runs from the config call that pointed it at this DemaxPlatform; later platform and config writes (transfer listener, fee values, counters) were not needed by the exploit.",
    "Victims are the eight DemaxPairs drained over 13 transactions. xBURGER has no DefiLlama price, so it is valued at the attacker's realised rate from selling xBURGER directly for USDT (25,000 xBURGER for 21,626.30 USDT, rule 15). BUSD uses DefiLlama's binance-usd quote."
